    "objective": "Advance the ball with accurate passes on the run, without travelling, and finish with a lay-up.",
    "setup": "Pairs on the baseline, five metres apart, one ball per pair.",
    "organization": "Pairs go one after another; return on the other side.",
    "instructions": [
      "Both players sprint up the court about five metres apart.",
      "Pass back and forth with chest passes ahead of the partner; no dribbling allowed.",
